OL,3,GNEWSASecond police incident on road
OL,4,Awhere six people injured after car
OL,5,Amounted pavement
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are dealing with a second
OL,8,Fincident on the same Glasgow road where
OL,9,Fsix pedestrians were injured when a car
OL,10,Fmounted a pavement on Tuesday.
OL,12,FOfficers closed Hyndland Road in the
OL,13,Fwest end of the city at about 16:50
OL,14,Ffollowing a report of concern for a
OL,15,Fperson.
OL,17,FIt came just 24 hours after a car
OL,18,Fmounted the pavement, and hit a bus
OL,19,Fstop and scaffolding before coming to a
OL,20,Fhalt. The road reopened at about 23:30.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
